          "3. Non-Refundable Deductions: In all cases, the following amounts shall be excluded from the refund:\n• The Company's administrative fees (whether a percentage or a flat fee, as announced at the time of booking).\n• Bank transfer fees and electronic payment processing charges.\n• Any amounts previously transferred by the Company to service providers that are deemed non-refundable under the providers' own policies."
