          "4. Refund Execution:\n• The refund process shall be completed within 15 to 30 working days from the date of approval of the cancellation request (subject to the turnaround times of banks and service providers).\n• The amount shall be refunded using the same original payment method (credit card, e-wallet, bank transfer).\n• If the original payment method has changed or been closed, the Client bears full responsibility for providing an alternative account and all associated transfer fees."
